From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chengzhong Wu <legendecas@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Nov 2025 21:43:58 +0000
Subject: src: backport the perfetto trace agent

Backports the perfetto-SDK based tracing agent from upstream so that Node's
trace events can be routed through the perfetto client Electron already
links (see fix_use_embedder_perfetto_client_when_available.patch). This is
the following upstream commits squashed, all of which are marked
dont-land-on-v24.x and so will not reach the Node.js line Electron
currently ships:

* build: perfetto-sdk (nodejs/node#64565)
* lib: add perfetto support (nodejs/node#64565)
* src: fix trace macro compatibility (nodejs/node#64565)
* src: add perfetto trace agent (nodejs/node#64565)
* src: fix perfetto build on GetTraceFilePath (nodejs/node#64721)
* src,test: disable trace events tests when perfetto is enabled (nodejs/node#64721)

This patch can be removed when Electron updates to a Node.js release that
contains nodejs/node#64565 and nodejs/node#64721.

